24,782\\)\n- \\(524,782 + 27,160 = 551,942\\)\n\nAnother verification using approximation:\n- \\(124,782 \\approx 125,000\\)\n- \\(427,160 \\approx 427,000\\)\n- \\(125,000 + 427,000 = 552,000\\)\n- Adjusting for the approximation difference: \\(552,000 - 58 = 551,942\\)\n\nThus, the sum of 124,782 and 427,160 is \\(\\boxed{551942}\\).",
