.\n- Then 1 in the hundreds place (100),.\n- 0 in the tens place,.\n- 1 in the ones place.\n\nSo when adding vertically, aligning each digit:.\n\n```.\n    3 4 3 4 5 4.\n+   5 2 4 1 0 1.\n----------------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the right (ones place):.\n\nOnes: 4 + 1 = 5. Write down 5.\n\nTens: 5 + 0 = 5. Write down 5.\n\nHundreds: 4 + 1 = 5. Write down 5.\n\nThousands: 3 (from first number) + 4 (from second number) = 7. Write down 7.\n\nTen thousands: 4 + 2 = 6. Write down 6.\n\nHundred thousands: 3 + 5 = 8. Write down 8. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
