sands:3+3=6 +1=7.\n\nTen thousands:8+1=9.\n\nHundred thousands:8+1=9.\n\nWait, so the total would be 9 (hundred thousands), 9 (ten thousands),7 (thousands),4 (hundreds),2 (tens),1 (ones). Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
