,000 + 15,254 and 200,000 - 3,864 (since 200,000 - 3,864 = 196,136).\n\nWait, but maybe that complicates. Alternatively, adding 115,254 + 200,000 would be 315,254, but since it's 196,136, that's 200,000 - 3,864. Therefore, 315,254 - 3,864 = ?\n\n315,254 minus 3,864:\n\n315,254 - 3,000 = 312,254.\n\nThen subtract 864 more: 312,254 - 800 = 311,454, then -64 = 311,390. Okay, same result. So that checks out.\n\nAlternatively, maybe adding the two numbers directly:\n\n115,254\n\n+196,136\n\nLet me add the thousands first: 115 thousands + 196 thousands = 311 thousands.\n\nThen the remaining parts: 254 + 136 = 390.\n\nSo total is 311,000 + 390 = 311,390. Yes, that's another way. So that works.\n\nHmm, so I think that's correct. So the answer should be 311,390. Let me just confirm with a calculator-style addition:\n\n115254\n\n+196136\n\nStart from the right:\n\n4+6=10 (0 with carry 1)\n\n5+3=8 +1=9 (9, no carry)\n\n2+1=3 (3)\n\n5+6=11 (1, carry 1)\n\n1+9=10 +1=11 (1, carry 1)\n\n1+1=2 +1=3 (3)\n\nSo 311390. Yeah, that's the same. I think that's right. So I'll go with 311,390 as the sum.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 115254 and 196136 is \\boxed{311390}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the sum of 115,254 and 196,136, we can add the numbers digit by digit starting from the rightmost digits:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n 115254 \\\\\n+196136 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nStarting from the ones place:\n- Ones place: \\(4 + 6 = 10\\). Write down 0, carry over 1.\n- Tens place: \\(5 + 3 = 8 + 1 = 9\\). Write down 9.\n- Hundreds place: \\(2 + 1 = 3\\). Write down 3.\n- Thousands place: \\(5 + 6 = 11\\). Write down 1, carry over 1.\n- Ten-thousands place: \\(1 + 9 = 10 + 1 = 11\\). Write down 1, carry over 1.\n- Hundred-thousands place: \\(1 + 1 = 2 + 1 = 3\\). Write down 3.\n\nCombining all the results, we get 311390.\n\nAnother verification method:\n- Break the numbers into parts: \\(115,254 + 196,136\\).\n- Add the thousands: \\(115,000 + 196,000 = 311,000\\).\n- Add the remaining parts: \\(254 + 136 = 390\\).\n- Combine the results: \\(311,000 + 390 = 311,390\\).\n\nThus, the sum of 115,254 and 196,136 is \\(\\boxed{311390}\\).",
