ite down 4.\n\nThousands place: 7 + 2 = 9. Write down 9.\n\nTen thousands place: 3 + 4 = 7. Write down 7.\n\nHundred thousands place: 9 + 8 = 17. Here, since 17 is two digits, we write down 7 in the hundred thousands place and carry over 1 to the millions place. Since there are no other digits in the millions place except the carried over 1, that becomes the millions digit. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
