is 11 (hundred thousands), 2 (ten thousands), 8 (thousands), 6 (hundreds), 3 (tens), 1 (ones). Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 65%|######5   | 326/500 [5:39:18<3:11:01, 65.87s/it]
