gether, starting from the right: 7 in the ones, 4 in the tens, 0 in the hundreds, 7 in the thousands, 1 in the ten-thousands, 5 in the hundred-thousands, 1 in the millions, and 1 in the ten-millions. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
