 + 7 = 7 plus the carried 1 is 8. Write 8.\n\nThousands place: 4 + 5 = 9. Write 9.\n\nTen-thousands place: 1 + 6 = 7. Write 7.\n\nHundred-thousands place: 2 + 3 = 5. Write 5.\n\nSo putting it all together: 5 (hundred thousands), 7 (ten thousands), 9 (thousands), 8 (hundreds), 1 (tens), 4 (units). Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
