Tens:8.\n\nHundreds:3.\n\nThousands:6.\n\nTen thousands:8.\n\nHundred thousands:12. Therefore, my final answer is: "]] 83%|########2 | 415/500 [7:14:34<1:22:33, 58.28s/it]
