ds place: 0 + 1 = 1. Write down 1.\n\nThousands place: 1 (from first number) + 2 (from second number) = 3. Write down 3.\n\nTen thousands place: 3 + 9 = 12. Hmm, here we get 12. So we write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next (hundred thousands) place.\n\nHundred thousands place: 1 (from first number) + 5 (from second number) + the carried over 1 = 1 + 5 + 1 = 7. So write down 7. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
